      "text": "FORMICARY CORROSION (Ant-Nest Pitting):\n    Rare; from organic compounds (formaldehyde, acetaldehyde)\n    Pattern: network of fine branching channels under examination\n    Sources: off-gassing building materials, formaldehyde-based products\n    Appears even in low-pH areas; requires organic acid presence"
    }
